          %h2#idea_use_a_string_of_spheres_not_just_one Idea: use a string of spheres not just one!
          %p
            Within the context of
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/proper+homotopy+theory"} proper homotopy theory
          %p
            Given a locally compact and
            = succeed "-compact" do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
