                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \varepsilon(\underline{S}^n)
                is a pro-space isomorphic to an
                = succeed "-indexed" do
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                    %semantics
                      %mrow
                        %mi ℕ
